## Limitations

- **Not a guarantee.** ScamShield is a decision aid and can be wrong. When in doubt, contact your bank or the helpline directly.
- **Dataset coverage.** Scam tactics evolve quickly, and a static dataset will lag behind new patterns.
- **Heuristic labels.** Part of the training data uses weak labels, which can introduce category noise.
- **Language coverage.** Performance on Hinglish and Hindi depends on how much real data was collected; per-language results are reported separately for this reason.
- **Privacy.** Do not paste sensitive details (passwords, OTPs, full card numbers) into any tool, including this one. Messages are redacted before any external lookup.

## Reporting a scam (India)

- 📞 **National Cyber Crime Helpline:** `1930`
- 🌐 **Online complaint:** [cybercrime.gov.in](https://cybercrime.gov.in)
- 🏦 If money or an OTP was shared, **contact your bank immediately**.

